The x-coordinate of the center is (9 + (-3))/2 = 6/2 = 3.
The y-coordinate of the center is (-5 + (-1))/2 = -6/2 = -3.

So, the coordinates of the center of the circle are (3, -3).

The sum of the coordinates of the center is 3 + (-3) = 0.

